            <run fontcolor='#e6e6e6' fontname='Helvetica' fontsize='14' italic='true'>The driver on pole won 172 of 329 races (52%). The red bars show each season&apos;s share. The dashed line is the overall average, and with only 16 to 24 races a year, much of the swing is luck.</run>
